2025 STATE OF WYOMING 25LSO-0115
SENATE FILE NO. SF0056
Providing false information to registered agents.
Sponsored by: Joint Corporations, Elections & Political
Subdivisions Interim Committee
A BILL
for
1 AN ACT relating to corporations, partnerships and
2 associations; amending the grounds for administrative
3 dissolution, revocation and forfeiture to include providing
4 false or fraudulent information to the registered agent;
5 and providing for an effective date.
6
7 Be It Enacted by the Legislature of the State of Wyoming:
8
9 Section 1. W.S. 17-16-1420(a)(vi)(B), (C) and by
10 creating a new subparagraph (D), 17-16-1530(a)(viii)(A),
11 (B) and by creating a new subparagraph (C),
12 17-19-1420(a)(v)(A), (B) and by creating a new subparagraph
13 (C), 17-19-1530(a)(vii)(A), (B) and by creating a new
14 subparagraph (C), 17-29-705(c)(iii)(B), (C) and by creating
1 SF0056

