4 17-16-1420. Grounds for administrative dissolution.
5
6 (a) The secretary of state may commence a proceeding
7 under W.S. 17-16-1421 to administratively dissolve a
8 corporation if any of the following has occurred:
9
10 (vi) It is in the public interest and the
11 corporation:
12
13 (B) Has provided fraudulent information or
14 has failed to correct false information upon request of the
15 secretary of state on any filing under this act with the
16 secretary of state; or
17
18 (C) Cannot be served by either the
19 secretary of state or the registered agent at its address
20 provided pursuant to W.S. 17-28-107;. or
21
22 (D) Has provided false or fraudulent
23 information to the registered agent, as determined by the
